window.products.push({"id":1137017,"name":"Cooler Kitchen Extra Large Rotating Stainless Steel Utensil Holder Caddy with Sturdy No-Tip Weighted Base, Removable Divider, and Gripped Insert Dishw","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mALOS-riL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Extra Large 7 Inches in Diameter & height, Sturdy Metal Construction, Dishwasher, Removable Divider and Gripped Insert. Our oversized utensil crock will hold all your kitchen utensils - saving space on your kitchen counter, stove or drawers. Designed as a deep oversized utensil holder, not a decorative bucket! Use our dividers for storing your kitchen gadgets (ladle, spatula, whisk, etc.) in each compartment for better organization 3 Pieces - Utensil Holder, Divider, and Internal Mat. Add To Cart Now! EXTRA LARGE MEANS BIG! - Stop cramming your utensils into small metal cups, or into a drawer that can barely close. Our utensil caddy is a generous 7 inches in diameter, allowing you to free up drawer space and stop rummaging for utensils every time you cook. There's no kitchen tool that won't fit: spoons, spatulas, whisks and more! Tall and sturdy so none of your tools will fall out. Will hold approximately 15-20 large handled tools right on your counter for your convenience! STURDY NO-TIP CONSTRUCTION - Our kitchen utensil organizer WILL NOT TIP OVER! Nothing is more frustrating than having your utensil holder tip over while you're cooking. Our jumbo utensil holder features a weighted base to keep it from tipping or sliding around during use. Stop using small, cheap cups that will tip and flip every time you use them. Our white utensil holder is the REAL DEAL! PERFECTLY DESIGNED -Unique modern Cooler Kitchen design features include 1) the convenience of a rotating base so you can reach every tool with ease on the fly 2) a tri-compartment divider to organize your tools more efficiently 3) a gripped insert at the bottom to ensure your tools don't slide around when in use 4) rubberized feet, so it won't scratch or stain your counter. CLEANING IS A BREEZE - Our cutlery holder has rubberized feet to ensure that it won't harm your counter or slide around, and is completely RUST-PROOF. The divider and gripped insert are easily removable, for hassle-free cleaning. The whole utensil crock is 100% DISHWASHER SAFE! OUR LARGE UTENSIL HOLDER IS A WONDERFUL ADDITION TO ANY KITCHEN- 7\" x7\" Inches, Sturdy Metal Construction, Dishwasher Safe, Removable Divider and Gripped Insert. Add To Cart Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mALOS-riL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cooler Kitchen","source_asin":"B07FSVNVF3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1137017","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FSVNVF3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FSVNVF3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
