window.products.push({"id":1137033,"name":"Innit Designs Concha Chair, Black Weave on Chrome Frame","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":391.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512stwAaDbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Concha Chair-contemporary dining or café chair, also cool as a guest chair in your living room or office and suitable for indoors and out. Composed of a metal base and seat hand-woven with solid vinyl cord. Available with white, chrome or black frame. The galvanized steel is rust resistant and the very durable yet flexible, UV protected vinyl will stay colorfast for year. It's comfortable without a cushion, weatherproof, breathable, easy to clean, and available in everybody's favorite color. A great, modern design for commercial and residential applications. Pretty good innit. Amazon.com Woven cafe/dining chair--close cousin to the popular Acapulco chair. view larger Ideal for indoor/outdoor seating at a restaurant, cafe, or for use at home. view larger Sleek, supportive, comfortable design--cushion optional (not included). Innit Designs Concha Chair Experience cool, contemporary style with this hot-weather Concha chair from Innit Designs. With its ultra-modern profile and eye-catching design, the fashionable chair works well as a cafe or dining chair, certain to wow friends and guests. Indoor/Outdoor Versatility With its rounded, slightly reclined, hoop-shaped frame and four sturdy legs, the Concha cafe/dining chair can be used for both residential and commercial applications. At home, the chair works well for an eat-in kitchen, dining room, or three-season porch--or for el fresco-style dining on the patio. It can also function as a guest chair in a living room or office. In a restaurant or cafe, guests will enjoy both the comfort and artful ambiance the chair creates when placed around tables indoors or when seating areas spill outdoors onto the sidewalk, up to the rooftop deck, or out into the garden. Stay-Cool Contemporary Design Inspired by the airiness of backyard rope hammocks, the Concha chair uses a traditional Mayan weaving technique to create a modern take on the classic woven chair. The chair's waterproof, UV-resistant vinyl cord comes securely wrapped around its recycled, rust-resistant, galvanized-steel frame, which provides a semi-textured polyester powder-coat for long-lasting durability and good looks from one season to the next. The chair's woven vinyl not only offers visual appeal and breathability, but also exceptional support and comfort--a seat cushion is optional (not included). Adding a 2-inch cushion would create a standard dining-chair height. Available in a Variety of Colors The Concha chair works well when paired with more than one (additional chairs sold separately). Keep all the chairs the same color to complement surrounding decor, or mix it up for a bold, vibrant color scheme that reflects your personal sense of style. The Concha chair comes with a white, chrome, or black frame with a solid vinyl cord that comes in a vast array of fun colors. Weatherproof, breathable, and easy to clean, the Concha chair measures 28 inches wide by 17 inches deep by 30 inches high with a 17-inch sitting height. Note: Images above may not reflect actual color. Concha Cafe/Dining Chair At a Glance UV-resistant, woven vinyl cord UV-resistant, woven vinyl cord Recycled, rust-resistant, galvanized-steel frame Recycled, rust-resistant, galvanized-steel frame Semi-textured polyester powder-coat Semi-textured polyester powder-coat For indoor/outdoor use For indoor/outdoor use Suitable for commercial applications Suitable for commercial applications Weatherproof, breathable, and easy to clean Weatherproof, breathable, and easy to clean Choose from a variety of colors. view larger","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512stwAaDbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Innit","source_asin":"B008ESBUJA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1137033","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008ESBUJA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008ESBUJA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
