window.products.push({"id":1137037,"name":"Xiran 84 feet 12 Strands of Artificial Ivy Wreath Greenery Decoration, Artificial Green Hanging Green Leaf Vines Wall, Party Wedding Room Interior and","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MmNKdu7tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"In Greek mythology, ivy represents Dionysus, the god of wine, a symbol of joy and vitality, and also represents eternal youth. We hope that our products can also add joy and vitality to your life. Why choose our artificial ivy? 1. Bright colors and exquisite shapes ,3D molding technology puts them in a three-dimensional shape instead of an aligned shape.  2. Rugged The silk artificial rattan leaves are tightly connected to the plastic stem by injection molding technology, which is not easy to fall off.  3. Waterproof The artificial greenery decoration can be washed with water, and the color of the leaves will hardly fade after ironing at high temperature. It is an ideal artificial plant for indoor and wooden boards.  4. 40 counts of green cable ties are in the package，will help with fast installation .  What other scenarios can ivy vine be used for?  1. Wedding decoration: wedding arches, tables, chairs, wreaths, gates, etc.  2. Party decoration: background, lighting, role playing, costume, birthday, magic forest decoration, etc.  3. Outdoor decoration: yard, opening, balcony, fence, garden, gatepost, lattice, swing, farmhouse, rockery, curtain, etc.  4. Indoor decoration: windows, bedrooms, kitchens, stairs, bookshelves, doors, ceilings, offices, mirrors, lights, exhibitions, etc.  Tips:  Since the materials are plastic and silk, the artificial ivy may have some smell at first after opening the box. If you think the smell of our products is too strong, you can choose the following treatment methods:  1. Put the ivy in a cool and ventilated place for a few days, wait for the smell to dissipate, and avoid the sun.  2. Wash the vines with warm water, then air-dry or blow dry.  3. During the packaging or transportation process, some leaves may fall off the garland, but it does not affect your normal use, and you can install them manually.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MmNKdu7tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Xiran","source_asin":"B08L3N44RY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1137037","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L3N44RY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L3N44RY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
