window.products.push({"id":1137086,"name":"PBRO 2 Piece Copper Crisper Tray,13\"L x9\" W Oven Pan,Non Stick Baking Tray,Oven Baking Pan & Mesh Basket Set,Air Fryer Pan,Microwave Bacon Tray,French","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hUZACqNFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"360 ° Thermal Cycle: The copper crispy cake machine with mesh design can promote the 360 ° air flow and thermal cycle of food. The circulating heating is more uniform and the food taste is better. The oil drain net and bottom tray can be put into the oven for baking. Carbon steel tray and stainless steel mesh basket set. Ergonomic Design: Humanized design, double-sided handle design of oil drain net, simple, durable and easy to grasp handle of air freezing plate, easy to lift and place after taking out the oven, and double-sided handle design is convenient to use. It is an essential kitchen helper. Wide Application: It is used for air crispy frying, French fries and baking. The bottom tray can be used separately from the oil drain net. It can participate in food storage and make an independent baking plate in the oven. The elevated mesh frying basket allows overheated air to pass through and circulate 360 degrees around the food to ensure that the food is cooked evenly. Usage: Before use, please wipe the oil drain net and tray with a soft cloth dipped in neutral detergent, and then dry them after washing with clean water. The frying basket and tray are suitable for any fried food, providing a healthy substitute without or less butter. Use air fried food instead of fried food. Can Cook All Foods: This air freezing plate is suitable for baking, frying and cooking all foods you like. Uniform air circulation can reduce the chance of food burning, and provide perfect crisp golden brown results again and again. You can cook evenly without turning over the food to make the food more crisper.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hUZACqNFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PBRO","source_asin":"B0B55Z8RB2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1137086","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B55Z8RB2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B55Z8RB2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
