window.products.push({"id":1137121,"name":"MEISTAR French Country Classic Style Wood 12 Inch Rooster Design Decorative Wall Clock,Silent Battery Operated Wall Clock for Living Room,Dining Room","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kZHuNJV6L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Thickness:0.35 inches(about 9mm) Materials:Eco-friendly wooden MDF(medium density fiberboard) Clock Cover:Covered by a colorful and exquisite surface coated paper with precise processing.Besides,there is a laminated film on the paper to keep the surface away from crumpling and color fading,and also make the clock cover waterproof and easy to wipe stain. Power Type:1 AA Carbon Zinc or Heavy Duty battery(not included) Package Includes: A Wall Clock A Hook A Specification Reasons to Buy 1.Great Wall Decoration and Gift:This wooden wall clock with delicate design is a great wall decoration to your house and office.Besides,it is also absolutely a prefect gift to others. 2.Precision Machining Silent Quartz Movement:Taiwan SUN 12888 scanning silent quartz movement is adopted to ensure the quietness and time accuracy of this wall clock,which provides you a comfortable environment to sleep and work. 3.Good Quality:Strict production process and high-quality materials ensure the good quality of this wall clock. Attentions 1.There is a detailed specification in the package.Please read it carefully before using this wall clock. 2.Due to long transportation,the clock hands maybe touch with each other.So sometimes the clock may not work well because of the wrong place of hands.Please reinstall the hands according to the specification. 3.This wall clock is unframed,and there is no glass face as the cover. 4.This wall clock should be powered by 1 AA Carbon Zinc or Heavy Duty battery(not included),instead of Alkaline battery. 5.Battery is not included in the package for it is limited by international transport. 6.There may be a slight difference between the picture and the real item because of different camera lens and light brightness. 100% Satisfaction Guarantee:If,for any reason,you are not completely satisfied with your purchase,please contact us for a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kZHuNJV6L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"meistar","source_asin":"B07C7L1PGY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1137121","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C7L1PGY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C7L1PGY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
