window.products.push({"id":1137145,"name":"Santa Barbara Design Studio GLS11-5527D Lolita Love My Wine Hand Painted Glass, Masquerade V","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b9WjcOIGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The masquerade #5 wine glass from Lolita's \"Love My Wine\" collection is distinctively painted to reflect its title and also includes a unique wine cooler recipe on the bottom of the stem. Every wine glass contains a different recipe and theme. Original Tracy Lolita Yancey designs on a generous 15-oz wine glass make a great gift for anyone, wine lover or not. This popular new shape for wine glasses is appropriate for either red or white wine. Its oversized 15-oz bowl allows ample space for wine to breathe, allowing the full potential of your cabernet, shiraz, merlot, chardonnay, Riesling or zinfandel to unfold. Don't like wine? Fill 'er up with your favorite juice or cocktail, even candy if you so choose. The individuality of each glass's theme makes them suitable for whomever comes to mind when you see them. The beautifully packaged, distinctively decorated, round and reusable gift box almost make this purchase two gifts in one. To put it simply, at Santa Barbara Design Studio, we make what we love and we love what we make. The one and only Lolita, who took hold of her original idea for a fancier martini glass and expanded it to fit absolutely any person and then took the world by storm in 2004 to become the hottest gift brand in the U.S. Now, after many successful products, designs and collections, she continues to stand behind what she has always believed.that life should be lived to its fullest and every moment should be celebrated. Lolita is THE original source for unique glassware designs. What is your moment? Commemorate it with a wine, margarita or martini glass, a shooter, rocks glass or pilsner. For whichever of life's big moments, there is a Lolita style to fit it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b9WjcOIGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Santa Barbara Design Studio","source_asin":"B00B84S9F0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1137145","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00B84S9F0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00B84S9F0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
