window.products.push({"id":1137460,"name":"Teeck Raindrops Shower Curtain, Shower Curtain Sets with 12 Hooks, Waterproof, Fabric, 72x72 Inch, Blue, for Bathroom, Easy to Install","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71z2j8zL0qL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Water that is wearing roller skates When I got this shower curtain, I laid it out horizontally on the table. At that time, I was holding a glass of water and preparing to take a sip. I suddenly sneezed, which made me violently shake the glass of water. The water spilled out all over the table, and of course, also on my pants. My pants were like an extremely thirsty child. They desperately and rapidly absorbed all of the water, and I had no time to wipe any of it off. When I looked at the table, I saw that the water that had just spilled on it had not been absorbed by the shower curtain. Instead, it had turned into dozens of droplets of water that were scattered on the shower curtain and that appeared especially dazzling under the lamp’s reflected light. These droplets looked just like diamonds, which I believe was an extremely unusual shape. When I lifted the shower curtain, the droplets acted as if they were wearing roller skates, and quickly slid downwards. You can benefit from our use of high-quality waterproof material for these shower curtains, which allows us to achieve the effect of water quickly sliding off them. Before you install this shower curtain, I recommend that you make droplets that look like gems, and then let them put on roller skates!! Specifications： Material: polyester fabric  Size: 72” Length x 72” Width  Package: shower curtain x 1 , top hooks x 12 pcs","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71z2j8zL0qL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TEECK","source_asin":"B07TXPNJYV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1137460","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TXPNJYV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TXPNJYV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
