window.products.push({"id":1137501,"name":"roro Hand-Crafted Reversible Appetizer Set, End-Grain Sustainable Wood, 5 Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lW8OmMTEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Appetizers. Meats. Antipasto. And More... This conversation inducing set has multiple uses. It's versatile to look charming and exciting serving everything from meats to appetizers to barbeque. It's beautiful enough that just arranging the platters as chargers. It's naturally one piece - not like many wood pieces which are fabricated. And importantly, this wood is sustainable and was not taken from forests. Simple Elegance This beautiful five piece set is handworded wood, complete with the bark. We minimized the lacquer to keep the natural look and feel of these pieces. These custom designed pieces are not mass-produced factory pieces as each piece of wood has to be selected and carved just right. The wood is first cut, then slowly dried in an oven using the remaining wood chips as fuel, allowing for the wood to dry out evenly, while not wasting any of the already chipped away wood. - Please handwash only. Do not submerge for more than 1-2 minutes at a time, allow time to air dry, and do not use in a dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lW8OmMTEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"roro","source_asin":"B01H8WO40Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1137501","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01H8WO40Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01H8WO40Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1137502,"name":"HKD-Pro Hook-On Conversion Bracket for Headboard Footboard to Bed Frame #65 Up Hook","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mnuVjaxAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you have a head-board or foot-board that needs attached to your metal bed frame? Will this adapter work for your needs? Here are a couple things to help determine if this bed hook will work for you: Does your head board or foot board have vertical slots on the legs with two horizontal \"pins\" inside? If so, this bracket should work. Do you need your bed frame to \"float\" (ie. headboard and footboard carry the weight of the frame, mattress, and person(s)? If so, these are NOT the correct hooks. Is your head-board and foot-board vintage, fragile, lightweight, or slightly damaged at the connection point? If so, these hooks will work. Do you want the bed-frame to help support the headboard or footboard? (ie, the legs of the headboard or footboard may be slightly held off the floor by the bed frame, if desired)? If so, these will work. Is your bed a twin, full, queen, or king size? These will work Q. Why would you want to \"float\" the headboard or footboard? A. If your headboard or footboard is decorative, lightweight, vintage, antique, or has damage at the legs or attachment points you can \"float\" it to ensure you are not putting weight/stress on it. Q. Do you need directions to install these? A. No, but we provide detailed written instructions (In english, written by us, for you :) with each set to give you streamlined tips and tricks to make the installation as easy as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mnuVjaxAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HKD-Pro","source_asin":"B01GZBJLX4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1137502","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GZBJLX4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GZBJLX4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1137503,"name":"Linendo Linen Tablecloth - 60 x 108 Inch Natural, Rectangle/Oblong Table Cover, 100% Pure European Natural Fabric Flax for Home and Kitchen Dinning Ta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yOf4joqcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make every occasion special with a 100% Pure Natural Linen Tablecloth from Linendo. Do more with less, our tablecloth is the best way to give a whole new image to your dining room. Enjoy the mildness of its beautiful color while having your morning breakfast with your family. Matching linen napkins are also available. Sizes: 60 x 84 inch / 60 x 108 inch / 60 x 120 inch. SOFT and DURABLE material. CLASSIC STYLE. White/Natural/Taupe Grey/Caramel colors with handsome look; mix and match colors for a remarkable dinner table in your dining room or kitchen. Great FOR ANY OCCASION. Whether it is celebratory dinner or a nice weekend breakfast, this linen accesory will make any occasion more special. EASY CARE as linen napkins are suitable for gentle machine washing and ironing. Preshrunk so it doesn't shrink anymore. Custom sizes available upon request. Prewashed for extra softness.These beautiful color tablecloth by LINENDO are perfect for everyday dinner, parties, Christmas, Easter, Valentines Day, Thanksgiving, New Year's Eve and every holiday.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yOf4joqcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"linendo","source_asin":"B09L1QHPSZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1137503","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L1QHPSZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L1QHPSZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1137504,"name":"Blow Torch/Culinary Torch - Kitchen Cooking Butane Torch - Creme Brulee Torch - Adjustable Flame Lighter with Safety Lock for Cooking, BBQ and Baking,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619BNuwR7HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It doesn’t matter if you are a cooking enthusiast, a Micheline star winning chef or just beginning to discover cooking, what matters is to do everything in style and with only the best kitchen utensils.  Our durable blow torch is ideal for various foods and deli preparations. Use it to brown meringues and sweet pies, make crisp toppings and melt cheese, toast bread crumbs and roast bell peppers, great for fruit and vegetable glazing. Instructions for use: Gas-refilled: please insert the Butane Gas Refill bottle vertically to the blow torch bottom as shows in picture , wait for 6 secs once and then pull out, 3 times operation will fully refill blow torch, wait for minutes then blow the fire. Light up and extinguish: turn fire ignition button to \"OPEN\", then press the button, the flame is lit; release the button, the flame goes off. To switch on continuous fire: turn fire ignition clockwise to \"CLOSE\" while the flame is on; Turn the button to \"OPEN\", the flame goes out. Adjustable flames: Slide the Flame control to adjust the flame levels. Precautions: - After working for 5 minutes, pause for a moment - Stay away from children when using, avoid direct targeting of human faces and flammable items - Avoid direct sunshine for long hours or place it at the place over 50 Celsius degrees - Use acceptable butane gas, otherwise it is possible to break the lighter or shorten service life - Butane Gas Not Included -Turn the Fire Ignition toward \"CLOSE\" when you are not using it Specification: - Flame Temperature: Up to 1300°C / 2500°F - Made with Aluminum alloy - Item size: 12 x 6 x 15.5 cm/ 4.7*2.3*6 inch - Net weight: 0.6lb","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619BNuwR7HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INTIPAL","source_asin":"B075ZSNB6M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1137504","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075ZSNB6M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075ZSNB6M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
