window.products.push({"id":1137507,"name":"Nicehill Storage Ottoman with Wooden Legs, Ottoman with Storage for Living Room, Folding Storage Ottoman Bench for Bedroom, Ottoman Foot Rest Stool, L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":56.03,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Rb9rRyG0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Storage Ottoman with Legs】The elegant ottoman storage is perfectly completed with European style gourd legs, along with button tufting and decorative stitching on top. Sleek rectangular design complements your existing decor, and the legs can prevent direct contact with the ground for moisture-proof storage and easier clean. Moreover, this ottoman with storage for living room comes with anti-skidding foot pads, which will prevent sliding while protecting your floors from scuffs and scratches. 【Multipurpose Ottoman With Storage】Nicehill Storage Ottoman is a stylish storage solution for pillows, blankets, toys or food in any room of your home. The storage ottoman bench will allow you to hide away all the mess, and add extra spacing & seating. And it is also basically a “ladies” ottoman foot rest, fits you fine with ankles usually crossed. | A great accompaniment to any home, as a toy chest, window bench, ottoman with storage for living room / for bedroom, coffee table, etc. 【Comfy & Durable Storage Bench】The luxurious feel of the linen upholstery is comfortable and inviting, and its durable construction (thicker high resilience sponge, sturdy medium-density fiberboard, and engineered wood combination) provides great seating experience and lasting use. We want to make sure you feel comfortable on this gray storage ottomans every minute - that's why we used a 1.57” thicker sponge top instead of a standard 1”. 【Humanized design & Easy to Remove】Simply remove the wooden leg and fold the storage ottoman when out of use, it only takes up little space when folded (30\" L x 15\" W x 3.3\" H). And with a lightweight design (15.4 LBS) for handling, Nicehill storage ottoman bench can be moved easily to any home, living room, bedroom, kid's playroom, office, fashion closet, college dorm, studio apartment, etc. 【Easy to Assemble & Good Service】Please following the installation videos, you will find the assembly is super easy. Unfolding, position base piece, set the metal bracket between the storage ottoman and the leg rightly, then spin the leg right and they will tighten up. (Tips: the metal bracket can provide added support/protection for the ottoman, please ensure the protruding edges of the metal bracket wrap the edge of the ottoman.) Feel free to contact us, we will reply you within 24 hours. 【Dimensions】Open Dimensions: 30\" L x 15\" W x 15\" H; Folded: 30\" L x 15\" W x 3.3\" H.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Rb9rRyG0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nicehill","source_asin":"B09JVPZSWZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1137507","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JVPZSWZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JVPZSWZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
