window.products.push({"id":1137649,"name":"Love My Cat Chocolate Candy Mold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ynyflzuRL._AC_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques.To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision.Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ynyflzuRL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B000EBMUMG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1137649","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EBMUMG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EBMUMG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1137650,"name":"Hedlive Kitchen Mat Set of 2 Cushioned Anti Fatigue Mat, Vintage Boho Print Cushioned Kitchen Rug 18\"x59\"+18\"x30\", Waterproof Non Slip Comfort Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DnYUsnukL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Extra Thick Cushioned Mat for Comfortable Support】0.4inch thicker kitchen floor mat with high density memory foam, which can provides more cushion and stability to helps relieve pressure on your feet, knees, back, & joints. This soft mat will offer undreamed-of levels of comfort for people who stand for long periods of time. 【Non-Slip & Suitable for Most Types of Floors】The anti-fatigue mats with heavy duty non-slip PVC backing, which makes the kitchen floor mat stick firmly onto various of floor, such as wood, ceramic, laminate, marble, concrete etc. These kitchen mat set with texture design to prevent it from sliding or rucking, avoid accident falls, and keep you safe. 【Waterproof Premium Materials & Easy to Clean】The antifatigue kitchen mats are made of high-quality PVC and thick foam which is waterproof, stain resistant, oil resistant. Easy to wipe, Simply clear dust on the mat with a vacuum cleaner or wipe stains with a damp cloth or sponge, keep your floor clean and new. No deformation, shedding and fading after cleaning. 【Universal Floor Mat Set & Eco-friendly】The 2-pack rugs for kitchen floor are measured as 18'' x 28'' and 18'' x 47'' in dimension, both sharing a thickness of 0.4 inch. These two different sizes make it suitable for most kitchen or other areas of the home, and you can use either according to the needs. Besides, the upgraded material of kitchen floor mat will not bring any odors in kitchen. 【Stylish Design & Versatile】Beautiful surface pattern design will bring a warm and relaxed feel for your family, and meet any home and kitchen decor easily. Suit for kitchen floor, standing desk, office, laundery room, farmhouse, the entry way, doorway, hallway and high traffic areas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DnYUsnukL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hedlive","source_asin":"B09FLQ2V8G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1137650","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FLQ2V8G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FLQ2V8G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
