window.products.push({"id":1137823,"name":"American Dryer Global GX3 ABS Cover Automatic Hand Dryer, 208-240V, 1,500W Power, 50/60Hz, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7128-gpj+FL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dry time of 40 seconds. Heavy duty, White ABS one piece cover. Vandal resistant design features 2 Tamper-resistant screws that secure cover to base. Air intake vents are shielded for additional safety. The Motor is permanently lubricated, maintenance free, brushless induction motor with automatic resetting thermal protector. 1/12 HP, 3100 RPM. Energy -efficient, microprocessor-controlled sensor turns dryer on when hands are under the outlet for up to 60 seconds. Standby power is only one watt. Features RoHS compliant lead-free design. Heating element is constructed of NiChrome resistance wire with thermal protector. Heating element operates in the black range for maximum life. 2-year limited warranty includes same day factory repair or replacement of part. Specifications Motor horsepower 1/12 hp Dry Time 40 Seconds Air flow 130 CFM (cubic feet per minute) Air velocity 4,000 LFM (linear feet per minute) Air temperature 120 degrees F at an ambient temperature of 72 degrees F Automatic shutoff time 80 seconds Sound level 63 dB Voltage rating 208/240 volts Amperage rating 6 amps Wattage 1,500 watts Cycle 50/60 hertz Overall dimensions* 9-3/8 x 10-1/8 x 5-5/8 inches (H x W x D) *H is height, the vertical distance from lowest to highest point; W is width, the horizontal distance from left to right; D is depth, the horizontal distance from front to back. Hand dryers have electric motors that blow heated air to dry hands with. They are mounted on a wall, and are hard wired to a dedicated electrical circuit. Hand dryers are typically installed in high traffic or public restrooms to reduce the costs associated with providing high volumes of clean towels and removing used ones.Search for ExtremeAir Hand Dryer to learn more about our complete line of high speed hand dryers. American Dryer's have been manufacturing quality hand dryers since 1952.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7128-gpj+FL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"American Dryer","source_asin":"B004FNZ3RS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1137823","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004FNZ3RS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004FNZ3RS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
