window.products.push({"id":1137934,"name":"Rosenthal Andy Warhol Marilyn Monroe Mugs, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QtmYUn9DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Marilyn Monroe was not only a Hollywood icon, Andy Warhol turned her into a pop art icon as well. For its jubilee collection, Rosenthal has applied her exquisite features to exquisite material. A range of attention-grabbing decorative images feature on a variety of accessories and limited wall plates. Based on Andy Warhol's original sketches for his famous portrait of Monroe. With the Monroe collection, the successful >> Warhol Celebrities< Amazon.com Andy Warhol challenged the contemporary art scene in the 1960s with his wildly colored silk-screened portraits of celebrities, including Marilyn Monroe. Rosenthal has adapted the now iconic Marilyn portrait for one of its outstanding Warhol collections of high-end porcelain and crystal giftware. When stacked to create one perfectly vertical column, these four different mugs complete multicolored portraits of Marilyn Monroe. Blue, pink, and yellow saturate the outside of the 9-ounce mugs, while the insides and playfully curved handles stay glossy white. The set makes a terrific gift for the pop art lover. Rosenthal, one of Germany's most prestigious porcelain manufacturers, demonstrates an impressive interest in art and design and has collaborated for decades with well-known artists. Other Warhol gift collections by Rosenthal include Campbell's Soup and Empire, based on his soup cans and black-and-white photos of New York, respectively. Each piece comes gift-ready in an Andy Warhol box and should be carefully washed by hand when necessary. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QtmYUn9DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rosenthal","source_asin":"B000BDHBD0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1137934","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000BDHBD0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000BDHBD0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
