window.products.push({"id":1137963,"name":"Liards Brass 7\" Tussie Mussie with Holder - Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31+Mi8f431L._AC_.jpg","description":"Brass tussie mussie with floral base. Mussie measures 7\"H The price is for two mussies and two holders. A tussy mussy is probably one of the most useful wedding accessories, yet so few people know about them. Every bride probably has a friend who has been married and has had the experience of her wedding bouquet being difficult to hold. A tussy mussy offers the bride and bridesmaids the best bouquet handle possible. Slipping the stems into the tussy mussy produces a beautiful handle that provides a comfortable feel and ease to hold. Many tussie mussies are available with stands so you may use it and your bouquet to accent your cake table at the reception. At the end of the wedding and reception, your wrists will thank you for putting such a practical handle on your bouquet. Many tussy mussy styles on the market are quite small. We strive to offer a variety of sizes that will match the bouquets that today's brides use in their weddings for the bride's bouquet, bridesmaids' bouquets, and mothers' bouquets. Although the purpose of a tussy mussy remains the same - to hold your bouquet - the styles do vary and so may the bouquet they hold. The most traditional form of a tussy mussy is in a conical shape like an ice cream cone. This shape provides a comfortable grip while providing plentiful space for the stems of the flowers being used.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31+Mi8f431L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Liards","source_asin":"B01C66VWT8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1137963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01C66VWT8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01C66VWT8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
